SUMMARY:Sunday Worship Service
LOCATION:Chapel
DESCRIPTION:Join us each Sunday for worship in the University Chapel\, le
 d by the dean of religious life and of the chapel\, that draws students\
 , faculty\, staff\, and community members together to hear God’s word\
 , sing praises\, and pray for the University and the world. For those un
 able to attend in person\, this service will be live streamed on the ORL
  YouTube page available through this link(Link is external) (https://www
 .youtube.com/officeofreligiouslifeprinceton)\nhttps://chapel.princeton.e
 du/events/sunday-worship-service-42
URL:https://chapel.princeton.edu/events/sunday-worship-service-42
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
