BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a2cecaee481b9f9e24758f81be2b0f0f
DTSTAMP:20261005T103042Z
DTSTART:20261029T163000Z
DTEND:20261029T170000Z
SUMMARY:After Noon Concert Series
LOCATION:Chapel
DESCRIPTION:The After Noon Concert Series is a weekly opportunity for the
  Princeton Community to enjoy performances at the Princeton University C
 hapel by various local\, national\, and international organists. These h
 alf-hour concerts showcase the flexibility of the magnificent Skinner/Ma
 nder Chapel organ. Each visiting organist rehearses and performs\, bring
 ing forth a different voice and character from the organ. Additionally\,
  several times each semester\, the concert is broadcast LIVE\, as it hap
 pens\, on the local classical music radio station\, WWFM (89.1)\, and av
 ailable to the world at www.wwfm.org(Link is external) (http://www.wwfm.
 org/). Questions? Contact Eric Plutz\, [eplutz@princeton.edu](mailto:epl
 utz@princeton.edu) \\*September 3 – Eric Plutz Princeton University Pr
 inceton\, NJ September 10 – John Linker Christ Church Transitional Cat
 hedral Christchurch\, New Zealand September 17 – Sean Burns Firs\nhttp
 s://chapel.princeton.edu/events/after-noon-concert-series-9
URL:https://chapel.princeton.edu/events/after-noon-concert-series-9
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b95ffbb4d083cd55222d69ad2b8a0a0a
DTSTAMP:20261012T103037Z
DTSTART:20261030T233000Z
DTEND:20261031T010000Z
SUMMARY:Meditations on the Mystery of the Holy Trinity by Olivier Messiae
 n
LOCATION:Chapel
DESCRIPTION:Dr. Gail Archer\, concert organist\, Professor at Barnard Col
 lege of Columbia University\, will perform the rarely heard Méditations
  sur le Mystère de la Sainte Trinité by Olivier Messiaen. Don’t miss
  this unique opportunity to experience the wonder of this pivotal work i
 n the majestic acoustics of the Princeton University Chapel.\nhttps://ch
 apel.princeton.edu/events/meditations-mystery-holy-trinity-olivier-messi
 aen
URL:https://chapel.princeton.edu/events/meditations-mystery-holy-trinity-
 olivier-messiaen
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
